Explaning tenure and land rights to our future generations of climate influencers. 🌎

#COP28"}}

{"en": {"title": "2022 was a year of both great progress and challenges for indigenous communities", "description": "Just a fraction of the nearly $2 billion pledge made to Indigenous Peoples and local communities has gone directly to them. Even so, 2022 was a year of great progress for indigenous communities.

Global support for indigenous tenure rights gained momentum and scientific evidence  continues to make it very clear that Indigenous Peoples and local communities protect nature and can help curb climate change.

Let's spend this year coming together to work in solidarity with and learn from Indigenous People and local communities"}}
